{
  "version": 1,
  "courseId": 995016,
  "courseSlug": "vuejs-2-the-complete-guide",
  "courseTitle": "Vue - The Complete Guide (incl. Router & Composition API)",
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "targetLanguage": "zh-TW",
  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "21463500",
      "title": "Prop Behavior & Changing Props",
      "lectureOrder": 95,
      "videoOrder": 81,
      "sourceHash": "52f0304e633890676af43273688f1dc491ded7d1a9e88f1d296663080107bc4b",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 1.36,
          "end": 4.45,
          "en": "Now as I emphasized in the last lecture,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 4.45,
          "end": 6.56,
          "en": "props are super important.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 6.56,
          "end": 9.67,
          "en": "We use them for something which is also called",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 9.67,
          "end": 12.29,
          "en": "parent child communication.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 12.29,
          "end": 15.77,
          "en": "So the parent component or app in this case,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 15.77,
          "end": 18.11,
          "en": "our main app, communicates",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 18.11,
          "end": 21.28,
          "en": "to its child HTML element",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 21.28,
          "end": 22.75,
          "en": "to its child component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 22.75,
          "end": 25.233,
          "en": "In this case to the friend contact component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 26.08,
          "end": 29.67,
          "en": "The friend contact component, is a child of this app",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 29.67,
          "end": 32.023,
          "en": "because we use it in the template of the app.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 33.61,
          "end": 36.38,
          "en": "On the other hand, for friend contact,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 36.38,
          "end": 38.27,
          "en": "the app would be the parent,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 38.27,
          "end": 40.01,
          "en": "because well, friend contact",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 40.01,
          "end": 42.38,
          "en": "gets used in the template of app.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 42.38,
          "end": 44.68,
          "en": "So these are just terms you can keep in mind,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 44.68,
          "end": 45.78,
          "en": "parent and child.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 45.78,
          "end": 48.13,
          "en": "And we use props to communicate",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 48.13,
          "end": 50.5,
          "en": "from the parent to the child.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 50.5,
          "end": 53.91,
          "en": "So to pass data from the parent to the child component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 53.91,
          "end": 56.823,
          "en": "from app to friend contact, in our case.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 57.82,
          "end": 60.67,
          "en": "Now here's one important thing you have to know about props",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 60.67,
          "end": 62.66,
          "en": "and which you should keep in mind.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 62.66,
          "end": 66.34,
          "en": "Props typically should not be mutated.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 66.34,
          "end": 68.13,
          "en": "And what do I mean by that?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 68.13,
          "end": 69.74,
          "en": "Let's add a new prop.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 69.74,
          "end": 71.461,
          "en": "Let's say here in App.vue,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 71.461,
          "end": 74.01,
          "en": "we have is favorite prop,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 74.01,
          "end": 77.03,
          "en": "which we passed to friend contact.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 77.03,
          "end": 78.85,
          "en": "And the value I pass here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 78.85,
          "end": 83.07,
          "en": "is one for a true or a zero for false.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 83.07,
          "end": 85.02799999999999,
          "en": "So here I pass isFavorite.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 85.02799999999999,
          "end": 87.373,
          "en": "And here let's say I set this to zero.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 89.18,
          "end": 92.12,
          "en": "Now that's a new prop, which we do for should add",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 92.12,
          "end": 96.113,
          "en": "here in friend contact isFavorite written like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 97.66,
          "end": 99.8,
          "en": "Now we've got, this isFavorite prop.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 99.8,
          "end": 103.96000000000001,
          "en": "Now let's say we wanna use that to output",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 103.96000000000001,
          "end": 106.163,
          "en": "some extra information after the name.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 107.08,
          "end": 108.82,
          "en": "Here with interpolation,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 108.82,
          "end": 112.45,
          "en": "I'm checking if isFavorite is equal to one",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 112.45,
          "end": 113.8,
          "en": "and if that's the case,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 113.8,
          "end": 115.65,
          "en": "I'll put some extra text here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 115.65,
          "end": 117.47999999999999,
          "en": "otherwise I won't.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 117.47999999999999,
          "end": 120.97,
          "en": "And the extra text is a pair of parentheses where I say",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 120.97,
          "end": 121.803,
          "en": "Favorite.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 123.39,
          "end": 125.01,
          "en": "If I now save that and reload,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 125.01,
          "end": 127.62,
          "en": "you see Favorite after Manuel Lawrence,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 127.62,
          "end": 130.28,
          "en": "because that is where I added isFavorite.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 130.28,
          "end": 133.75,
          "en": "And after Julie Jones, we don't see that because there,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 133.75,
          "end": 136.26,
          "en": "I set isFavorite to zero.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 136.26,
          "end": 138.27,
          "en": "Now, why am I doing that?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 138.27,
          "end": 141.45,
          "en": "Well, let's also see we have another button here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 141.45,
          "end": 144.223,
          "en": "which allows us to change the favorite status.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 149.05,
          "end": 153.01,
          "en": "I'll say Toggle Favorite on the button.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 153.01,
          "end": 154.46,
          "en": "And I'll add a new method.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 154.46,
          "end": 156.32,
          "en": "toggleFavorite could be the name",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 157.17000000000002,
          "end": 158.66,
          "en": "to which I wanna point here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 158.66,
          "end": 160.62,
          "en": "with the click listener on that button.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 160.62,
          "end": 162.91,
          "en": "And now we add this method here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 162.91,
          "end": 165.043,
          "en": "in the methods, toggleFavorite.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 166.64,
          "end": 171.64,
          "en": "And in here, I'll check if this isFavorite is equal to one.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 171.8,
          "end": 174.62,
          "en": "So if we were a favorite,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 174.62,
          "end": 176.897,
          "en": "in which case I'll set it to zero",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 178.973,
          "end": 183.723,
          "en": "and otherwise, if isFavorite was zero I'll set it to one.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 185.58,
          "end": 187.79,
          "en": "we could do it as to change the favorite status",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 187.79,
          "end": 189.29,
          "en": "with help of the button.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 189.29,
          "end": 191.773,
          "en": "If we saved it, we get an error here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 192.68,
          "end": 196.9,
          "en": "The error is unexpected mutation of isFavorite prop.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 196.9,
          "end": 200.25,
          "en": "As I mentioned, that's not something you should do.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 200.25,
          "end": 202.34,
          "en": "Now, why should you not do that?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 202.34,
          "end": 205.37,
          "en": "Because Vue uses a concept which is called",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 205.37,
          "end": 207.91,
          "en": "unidirectional data flow.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 207.91,
          "end": 209.93,
          "en": "Now that's again a fancy term,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 209.93,
          "end": 211.9,
          "en": "but it means one simple thing.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 211.9,
          "end": 215.77,
          "en": "Data passed from app to friend contact",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 215.77,
          "end": 220.17000000000002,
          "en": "should only be changed in app, not in friend contact.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 220.17000000000002,
          "end": 224.21,
          "en": "We just pass data down to friend contact.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 224.21,
          "end": 226.7,
          "en": "And once the data is passed down,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 226.7,
          "end": 231.11,
          "en": "friend contact cannot change the data we manage an app view,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 231.11,
          "end": 235.22,
          "en": "at least not by simply changing the received data.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 235.22,
          "end": 238.82,
          "en": "So if we change data inside of friend contact like here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 238.82,
          "end": 241.1,
          "en": "when I tried to change isFavorite,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 241.1,
          "end": 243.36,
          "en": "this is not allowed by Vue,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 243.36,
          "end": 245.41,
          "en": "because we violate this pattern",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 245.41,
          "end": 247.913,
          "en": "of having a unidirectional data flow.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 248.77,
          "end": 250.95,
          "en": "Now, if we want to change this,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 250.95,
          "end": 253.66,
          "en": "there are two ways of doing that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 253.66,
          "end": 257.23,
          "en": "The first way of doing it, is that we let the parent know",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 257.23,
          "end": 259.36,
          "en": "that we'd like to change this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 259.36,
          "end": 263.25,
          "en": "Then the parent can go ahead and change the data in itself",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 263.25,
          "end": 266.97,
          "en": "and pass the updated data back to friend contact.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 266.97,
          "end": 269.63,
          "en": "That's a pattern we'll explore later.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 269.63,
          "end": 270.86,
          "en": "It's an important pattern",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 270.86,
          "end": 274.09000000000003,
          "en": "and will therefore have a detailed look at it soon.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 274.09000000000003,
          "end": 277.85,
          "en": "The other approach is that we simply take the received data",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 277.85,
          "end": 281.24,
          "en": "as the initial data, inside of friend contact,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 281.24,
          "end": 284.52,
          "en": "and then we changed that data instead of friend contact,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 284.52,
          "end": 288.40999999999997,
          "en": "but we are aware of the fact that we only change it there",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 288.40999999999997,
          "end": 293.2,
          "en": "and that this won't affect the data in App.vue.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 293.2,
          "end": 295.5,
          "en": "To implement this pattern,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 295.5,
          "end": 299.85,
          "en": "all we need to do is we need to add a new data property",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 299.85,
          "end": 301.063,
          "en": "in our component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 303.47,
          "end": 305.9,
          "en": "for example, friendisFavorite.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 305.9,
          "end": 309.12,
          "en": "So using a different name than I used here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 309.12,
          "end": 312.41,
          "en": "and now we'll set this equal to this isFavorite.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 312.41,
          "end": 315.453,
          "en": "So set it equal to the received prop value.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 316.68,
          "end": 320.73,
          "en": "Then we use the received prop value just as an initial value",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 320.73,
          "end": 322.56,
          "en": "for friendisFavorite.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 322.56,
          "end": 326.044,
          "en": "And now friend is Favorite can be used here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 326.044,
          "end": 327.77,
          "en": "friendisFavorite,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 327.77,
          "end": 328.873,
          "en": "in the template,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 330,
          "end": 332.05,
          "en": "but also in the rest of the code.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 332.05,
          "end": 336.05,
          "en": "And if we now change that friendisFavorite property,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 336.05,
          "end": 338.2,
          "en": "that will be okay,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 338.2,
          "end": 341.22,
          "en": "because that's now our regular data property,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 341.22,
          "end": 343.08,
          "en": "where the prop we received",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 343.08,
          "end": 346.09000000000003,
          "en": "is just used to set an initial value.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 346.09000000000003,
          "end": 349.743,
          "en": "So now that works and I can toggle this favorite status.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 351.36,
          "end": 354.32,
          "en": "I'm emphasizing this and talking about this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 354.32,
          "end": 356.82,
          "en": "because this unidirectional data flow",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 121,
          "start": 356.82,
          "end": 358.71,
          "en": "is an important concept.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 122,
          "start": 358.71,
          "end": 361.06,
          "en": "Now of course you will have scenarios",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 123,
          "start": 361.06,
          "end": 363.06,
          "en": "where you want to be able",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 124,
          "start": 363.06,
          "end": 365.17,
          "en": "to change the original data",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 125,
          "start": 365.17,
          "end": 367.06,
          "en": "you got from the App.vue file.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 126,
          "start": 367.06,
          "end": 369.95,
          "en": "So where just using it as initial data",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 127,
          "start": 369.95,
          "end": 373.25,
          "en": "and then changing it internally is not enough.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 128,
          "start": 373.25,
          "end": 374.82,
          "en": "Therefore, we'll also very soon",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 129,
          "start": 374.82,
          "end": 377.09,
          "en": "have a look at how you can implement that,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 130,
          "start": 377.09,
          "end": 380.57,
          "en": "for the moment be aware that you should not mutate props,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 131,
          "start": 380.57,
          "end": 381.91,
          "en": "but if you need to do it,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 132,
          "start": 381.91,
          "end": 384.83,
          "en": "you can just take a prop as an initial value",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 133,
          "start": 384.83,
          "end": 388.163,
          "en": "and then change the component exclusive property and stat.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "errors": []
}
